# Native Python Transcription Runtime

Status: DONE
Milestone: M2 Native operation, before optional Docker packaging
Dependencies: None
Reference workstream: 04_PROJECT_FOUNDATION.todo (the headless Python runtime can run independently)

## Purpose

Run the C# desktop app with a normal local Python recognizer, with no Docker installation or service dependency.

## Tasks

- [x] Make Initialize-Transcription provision a service-local Python environment and pinned dependencies.
- [x] Make Start-Transcription default to native Python; retain Docker only as an explicit opt-in.
- [x] Add authenticated instance-scoped startup/reuse/shutdown; never terminate unrelated processes.
- [x] Refuse shutdown during active transcription instead of discarding audio.
- [x] Start the native service from the app launcher; allow explicit NotesOnly and independent recovery.
- [x] Keep the existing C# PCM/WebSocket contract unchanged and container-neutral.
- [x] Exercise setup/start/reuse/status/stop and real C# plus synthetic-stream recognition without Docker.
- [x] Record native lifecycle evidence, failure boundaries and current user instructions.

## Acceptance criteria

- [x] This host without Docker starts/stops local transcription through the normal launcher.
- [x] The service persists beyond the starter, stays loopback-authenticated, and records no audio.
- [x] Active-session and mismatched/untracked-instance guards reject shutdown; no arbitrary OS kill exists.
- [x] Native results are distinguished from still-deferred container execution.

## Completion evidence

- Native runtime manager, management endpoints and scripts implemented;37service/management tests pass.
- Native setup/start/reuse/status and owned graceful shutdown pass after the starter process exits.
- Run-PhantomFudge -NoBuild automatically starts native service and creates the app; minimize/relaunch/
  hide/relaunch/native-close passes, then the owned service stops. No Docker or audio capture.
- Silent5.9s real Vosk recognition:11partials/2finals/7keywords/tail+silence; actual C#client->nativePython
  produced13partials/2finals and expected synthetic phrase. No speaker output or real meeting data.
- No cloud ASR, microphone capture, speaker playback or Docker installation is part of this work.

